    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1591">

                <pb facs="1283" n="1167" xml:id="pg1167"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 819.001 P 82/4.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the American Chargé
                        d’Affaires</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 89.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-11-14">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 14, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I enclose, with office copy, a letter
                    addressed by the President to His Excellency Belisario Porras, acknowledging his
                    letter of October 1 last in which he announced his election to the Presidency of
                    Panama and his entrance upon the duties of that office.</p>
                <p>You will forward the copy to the Foreign Office and deliver the original in the
                    manner most agreeable to His Excellency.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.],</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">P. C. Knox.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d1591-a1.xml" xpointer="d1591-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
